problem_statement:
Add compatible versions range to `metadata.json` files
Add an optional key to `metadata.json` files to enforce version requirements:

```json
{
  "versions": [453]
}
```

```json
{
  "versions": [429, 453]
}
```

The first value indicates the minimum version, second value indicates the last version. If no second value is present, it is assumed that all version >= the minimum version are supported.

